# Audio is served from per-surah GitHub Releases via NEXT_PUBLIC_AUDIO_BASE_URL,
# not from the deployment. The full recitation is 6,236 files / 2.5 GB, which
# exceeds what Vercel accepts — and a local `vercel deploy` would otherwise try
# to upload every one of them, since the CLI packages the working directory
# rather than the git index.
#
# Remove this line to serve audio from the deployment again (only viable for a
# small subset of surahs).
public/audio
